{"seq":2,"slug":"resolution","title":"分辨率与像素密度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/video-fundamentals/resolution","wordCount":977,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"分辨率与像素密度\">分辨率与像素密度</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>分辨率（Resolution）定义了视频画面的空间精细度——它是水平像素数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> 垂直像素数的二维量。从 SD（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>720</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>480</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">720 \\times 480</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">720</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">480</span></span></span></span></span>）到 8K（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7680</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4320</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7680 \\times 4320</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7680</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4320</span></span></span></span></span>），分辨率的提升是视频技术进步的最直观体现。但分辨率本身只是数字，真正决定画面精细度的是<strong>像素密度</strong>（PPI/PPD）——即观看条件下每度视角包含多少像素。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Resolution System&lt;br/&gt;分辨率体系&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;SD Era&lt;br/&gt;标清时代&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;HD Era&lt;br/&gt;高清时代&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;UHD Era&lt;br/&gt;超高清时代&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;480i/576i&lt;br/&gt;DVD&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;720p&lt;br/&gt;HD Ready&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;1080p&lt;br/&gt;Full HD&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;4K (2160p)&lt;br/&gt;UHD-1&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;8K (4320p)&lt;br/&gt;UHD-2&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Resolution System&lt;br/&gt;分辨率体系\"] --&gt; B[\"SD Era&lt;br/&gt;标清时代\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"HD Era&lt;br/&gt;高清时代\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"UHD Era&lt;br/&gt;超高清时代\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"480i/576i&lt;br/&gt;DVD\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"720p&lt;br/&gt;HD Ready\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"1080p&lt;br/&gt;Full HD\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"4K (2160p)&lt;br/&gt;UHD-1\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"8K (4320p)&lt;br/&gt;UHD-2\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>分辨率（Resolution）</strong>：画面的空间精细度，用水平 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> 垂直像素数表示，从 SD 到 8K 逐级提升。</li>\n<li><strong>像素密度（PPD/PPI）</strong>：每度视角或每英寸包含的像素数，与观看距离、屏幕尺寸共同决定实际清晰度。</li>\n<li><strong>宽高比（Aspect Ratio）</strong>：画面宽高之比，从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4:3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16:9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>21</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">21:9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">21</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span> 与竖屏 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9:16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span>，决定构图与适配。</li>\n<li><strong>色度子采样</strong>：利用人眼对色度不敏感，以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4:2:0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 等格式降低色度采样，是消费视频的默认选择。</li>\n<li><strong>位深（Bit Depth）</strong>：每个分量的量化级数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>-bit 用于 SDR、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>-bit 以上服务 HDR 与调色。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"分辨率标准\">分辨率标准</h2><h3 id=\"主流分辨率对比\">主流分辨率对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>像素 (W×H)</th>\n<th>总像素量</th>\n<th>相对 1080p</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>480p (SD)</td>\n<td>720×480</td>\n<td>0.35M</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.16</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.16\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.16</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>DVD、老视频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>720p (HD)</td>\n<td>1280×720</td>\n<td>0.92M</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.44</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.44\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.44</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>网络直播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1080p (FHD)</td>\n<td>1920×1080</td>\n<td>2.07M</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>通用标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1440p (2K)</td>\n<td>2560×1440</td>\n<td>3.69M</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.78</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.78\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.78</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>游戏显示器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2160p (4K UHD)</td>\n<td>3840×2160</td>\n<td>8.29M</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>电视/流媒体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DCI 4K</td>\n<td>4096×2160</td>\n<td>8.85M</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4.27</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4.27\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.27</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>电影院</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4320p (8K)</td>\n<td>7680×4320</td>\n<td>33.2M</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>前沿/VR</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"画面宽高比\">画面宽高比</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Aspect Ratio</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>W</mi><mi>H</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Aspect Ratio} = \\frac{W}{H}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Aspect Ratio</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>宽高比</th>\n<th>数值</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>4:3</td>\n<td>1.33:1</td>\n<td>老电视/iPad</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16:9</td>\n<td>1.78:1</td>\n<td>现代电视/网络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.85:1</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>美国院线宽银幕</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2.39:1</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>变形宽银幕</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>21:9</td>\n<td>2.33:1</td>\n<td>超宽屏显示器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9:16</td>\n<td>0.56:1</td>\n<td>竖屏短视频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1:1</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>Instagram 方形</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"像素密度与观看距离\">像素密度与观看距离</h2><h3 id=\"视角分辨率\">视角分辨率</h3><p>人眼的极限分辨力约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 角分（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/60°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/60°</span></span></span></span></span>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PPD (Pixels Per Degree)</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>pixels</mtext></msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>screen</mtext></msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>180</mn><mi>π</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PPD (Pixels Per Degree)} = \\frac{W_{\\text{pixels}}}{2 \\times \\arctan\\left(\\frac{W_{\\text{screen}}}{2d}\\right) \\times \\frac{180}{\\pi}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PPD (Pixels Per Degree)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4888em;vertical-align:-1.1284em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2216em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">arctan</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8884em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\