tyle=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pixels</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1284em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>PPD</th>\n<th>感知</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>可见像素</td>\n<td>看得到颗粒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30–50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30–50</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>清晰但非极致</td>\n<td>一般观看</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50–60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50–60</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>视网膜级</td>\n<td>看不到像素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>超采样</td>\n<td>浪费（除非裁切）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"推荐观看距离\">推荐观看距离</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分辨率</th>\n<th>视网膜级距离 (65&quot; 电视)</th>\n<th>实际推荐</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1080p</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>2.5</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 2.5m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2–3m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2–3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>1.2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 1.2m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5–2m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5–2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 0.6m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.8</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>1.5</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.8–1.5m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8–1.5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"采样与子采样\">采样与子采样</h2><h3 id=\"色度子采样\">色度子采样</h3><p>人眼对亮度的分辨力远高于色度——视频编码利用这一特性对色度信号降采样：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>YCbCr 子采样</mtext><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{YCbCr 子采样}: 4:x:y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">YCbCr </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">子采样</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>色度采样</th>\n<th>数据比例</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>4:4:4</td>\n<td>全采样</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>调色/图形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4:2:2</td>\n<td>水平半采样</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>67</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">67\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">67%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>专业视频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4:2:0</td>\n<td>水平+垂直半采样</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>消费视频/流媒体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4:1:1</td>\n<td>水平1/4采样</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>DV (已过时)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;4:4:4&lt;br/&gt;全采样&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;4:2:2&lt;br/&gt;专业中间&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;4:2:0&lt;br/&gt;分发输出&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"4:4:4&lt;br/&gt;全采样\"] --&gt; B[\"4:2:2&lt;br/&gt;专业中间\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"4:2:0&lt;br/&gt;分发输出\"]</pre><h3 id=\"位深与量化\">位深与量化</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>位深</th>\n<th>亮度级数</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>文件体积</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>8-bit</td>\n<td>256</td>\n<td>SDR 分发</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10-bit</td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>HDR 标准</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.25</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.25\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.25</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12-bit</td>\n<td>4096</td>\n<td>RAW/中间</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"分辨率选择策略\">分辨率选择策略</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>决策因素</th>\n<th>低分辨率选择</th>\n<th>高分辨率选择</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>带宽限制</td>\n<td>720p/1080p</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储空间</td>\n<td>1080p</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后期裁切</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>4K (裁切到1080p)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大屏放映</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>4K/8K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VR/360°</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>8K+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时直播</td>\n<td>1080p</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>分辨率是视频的空间精度——但它的价值只在观看条件下才能实现。盲目追求最高分辨率会带来存储、带宽和计算的巨大开销，而对观看体验的提升可能微乎其微。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核心概念</th>\n<th>关键数值</th>\n<th>决策依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分辨率</td>\n<td>像素总量</td>\n<td>输出目标设备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>像素密度</td>\n<td>PPD</td>\n<td>观看距离+屏幕尺寸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子采样</td>\n<td>4:2:0 vs 4:2:2 vs 4:4:4</td>\n<td>后期需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位深</td>\n<td>8/10/12-bit</td>\n<td>SDR vs HDR</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分辨率与像素密度","id":"分辨率与像素密度"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分辨率标准","id":"分辨率标准"},{"level":3,"text":"主流分辨率对比","id":"主流分辨率对比"},{"level":3,"text":"画面宽高比","id":"画面宽高比"},{"level":2,"text":"像素密度与观看距离","id":"像素密度与观看距离"},{"level":3,"text":"视角分辨率","id":"视角分辨率"},{"level":3,"text":"推荐观看距离","id":"推荐观看距离"},{"level":2,"text":"采样与子采样","id":"采样与子采样"},{"level":3,"text":"色度子采样","id":"色度子采样"},{"level":3,"text":"位深与量化","id":"位深与量化"},{"level":2,"text":"分辨率选择策略","id":"分辨率选择策略"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"帧率与时间基准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/video-fundamentals/frame-rate"},"next":{"title":"扫描方式与场序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/video-fundamentals/scan-methods"}}